      "generationRecord": "output/image-fixes-2026-10-05/characters/generation-jobs.json",
      "prompt": "Precise equipment correction on this exact transparent Union of Kingdoms fire-archer sprite. Keep the original tier identity, face, white hair, pointed ears, red role hood and dress, natural skin, boots, bow shape and decoration, metal colors, armor complexity, fiery arrow and pose unchanged. Correct ONLY the bowstring: the archer is drawing the arrow with her right draw-hand to the LEFT of the bow. Draw a single taut continuous bowstring as a clear V from the upper bow tip to the arrow NOCK precisely at that LEFT draw-hand, then from that same nock/draw-hand to the lower bow tip. Both strands must visibly connect to that one nock point. The bow is held by her extended other hand at the RIGHT grip. The string must NOT connect to the right grip, be straight from tip to tip, have extra strands, or miss the drawn arrow. Remove the old incorrect string. Preserve original role/tier palette, do not upgrade equipment or add jewels. True transparent alpha, full body inside the image with margins, same painterly chibi game style, no text, no background or checkerboard.",
