      "prompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Edit this transparent Union of Kingdoms fire-archer sprite to correct bow mechanics, preserving the character, pose, proportions, red hood, long white hair, purple tier-five jewels, ornate crescent bow, flaming arrow and full-body square composition. The archer's left visible arm extends right to hold the bow grip. The right visible drawing hand is back near her chest at the LEFT end of the arrow. DRAW ONE CLEAR taut bowstring as two thin continuous segments: upper bow-tip to arrow NOCK at the drawing hand near the chest, then that SAME nock to lower bow-tip. The string forms a pulled sideways V whose left vertex is the arrow's rear end in the drawing fingers. Remove the incorrect straight string that currently runs down by the bow grip. There must not be a second undrawn string. The arrow rests across the grip, horizontal toward the right, with a single flame arrowhead beyond the bow. Fingers grip the nock/string believably. No loose disconnected strings. Preserve all other details, bold dark outlines, chibi storybook art, purple equipment accents, both feet, transparent alpha background and generous margins. No text, frame, extra limbs, added arrows, ground or backdrop.",
